This repository builds on the following open-source projects. Their original
licenses and notices apply to the corresponding files.

1. SLBR: Visible Watermark Removal via Self-calibrated Localization and
   Background Refinement
   https://github.com/bcmi/SLBR-Visible-Watermark-Removal
   The stage-1 backbone (shared-decoder U-Net, SMR and MBE blocks) and the
   overall training scaffold are adapted from this repository. The upstream
   project does not declare a license; please confirm its terms before
   redistributing those files.
   Files: src/networks/blocks.py, src/networks/rirci.py (stage 1),
          src/models/BasicModel.py

2. MAXIM: Multi-Axis MLP for Image Processing
   https://github.com/google-research/maxim
   License: Apache-2.0
   Files: src/modules/MAXIM.py (GridGmlpLayer local/global MLP)
          src/modules/FFT.py (FFC / spectral transform)

3. Fast Fourier Convolution (FFC)
   https://github.com/pkumivision/FFC
   License: Apache-2.0
   Files: src/modules/FFT.py

4. pytorch-ssim
   https://github.com/Po-Hsun-Su/pytorch-ssim
   License: MIT
   Files: pytorch_ssim/__init__.py

5. pytorch_iou (IoU loss)
   Vendored without an upstream header; the original terms apply.
   Files: pytorch_iou/__init__.py

The stage-2 design (dual-path background restoration with global/local context
interaction and non-local fusion) and its loss terms are the contribution of
this paper.

The Apache-2.0 license text for the components above is included in
third_party_licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.

Please retain this NOTICE and the third_party_licenses directory when
redistributing the code.
